ます。ポーズと表情は先生好きのように描いてください。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-h7-U0JdEkXALVfXmLE4piS9YZ7dwLp3\nよろしくお願いします!", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@gj_tl1/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3152789, "client_id": 2724099, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1feeb4ef/uploads/origins/8ac618d7-9495-4e36-a724-beb2da56b6f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2599a28b8103934885c213977b2149f8", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1feeb4ef/uploads/origins/8ac618d7-9495-4e36-a724-beb2da56b6f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dbe1a28d1b674d6beff66ee34f64e032", "src_set": ""}, "body": "むの様はじめまして、いつも素敵な作品拝見しております！\n是非当方の創作キャラクターを描いて頂きたくリクエストさせて頂きます…！\n\n服装はリンク内のもの、構図はおまかせさせて頂きたいです‪(  . .)\"‬\n\nOC⬇️\n・トルゥーディ\n年齢不詳\n芸術・美術に秀でた国 arsを治めている\n緊張しぃで小心者\n恋人の前ではおしゃべりになる\n\n金額不足等あれば再送の方頂けますと幸いです…！\n宜しくお願い致します⸜🙌🏻⸝‍\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1JfTH6TRP89iAEc04G8DDutbuP2a2vEJ1\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1JfTH6TRP89iAEc04G8DDutbuP2a2vEJ1", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@gj_tl1/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3152789, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e54a94a1/uploads/origins/fc0c5993-7c44-4aa6-a01d-99fe30df9bc5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cac83d48eedf9267bf2665435f5e7f79", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e54a94a1/uploads/origins/fc0c5993-7c44-4aa6-a01d-99fe30d